  year         = {2026},
  abstract     = {Winner of the Global South AI Safety Hackathon (1 of 3 winning teams out of 217, competing solo). I adapt the Thought Anchors resampling framework to chain-of-thought interpretability and attribute which reasoning steps push extended-thinking LLMs (Claude Sonnet 4.6, Gemini 2.5 Flash, Qwen3.7-Plus) toward stereotypical outputs in Latin American scenarios. Reproducible pipeline, paper, and interactive demo built in about 24 hours.}
